<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12758] zookeeper discovery does not work due to missed dependency</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12758</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;in new zookeeper 3.5.5 version part of classes were moved in new jar:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.zookeeper/zookeeper-jute/3.5.5&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.zookeeper/zookeeper-jute/3.5.5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
which is missed in Apache Ignite release.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Sever fails to start with the following exception:&lt;/p&gt;

